<title>JAPAN: TSE applies to list Cats on 2nd section.</title>
<headline>TSE applies to list Cats on 2nd section.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Monday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry to list Cats Inc on the second section of the bourse.</p>
<p>Cats, a pest control company, is likely to be listed on July 25 and, subject to market conditions, 500,000 new shares will be offered, TSE said in a statement.</p>
<p>The shares are currently registed for over-the-counter trade.</p>
</text>
